{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/est1.png?t=1744105729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Iron Frontier is a roguelike card real time strategy game. Plants vs Zombies marries Age of War with Brotato progression system. It blends multiple genres into a hot mix of action, tactics and strategic decisions to create unique player experience. Welcome back, Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/St1.gif?t=1744105729\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/est2.png?t=1744105729\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy armada is closing on your position from both sides. Establish a base and use all means to protect it. Commander, this is your last Iron Frontier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/text_223.png?t=1744105729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/St2.gif?t=1744105729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your army from dozens of units and buildings. Command your troops to hit the enemy where it hurts. Use airstrikes and other abilities to rain death on the battlefield!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/est4.png?t=1744105729\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your troops with hundreds of upgrades and power ups. Unlock new units, technologies and permanent upgrades to turn your army into a killing machine!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/est5.png?t=1744105729\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Annihilate enemy forces with cunning tactics and extreme firepower. Create insane builds to turn the battleground into a kill zone! No prisoners, no survivors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you on the battlefield!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2131290?t=1744105729","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744105729","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744105729","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744105729","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2286210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/est1.png?t=1744105729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Iron Frontier is a roguelike card real time strategy game. Plants vs Zombies marries Age of War with Brotato progression system. It blends multiple genres into a hot mix of action, tactics and strategic decisions to create unique player experience. Welcome back, Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/St1.gif?t=1744105729\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/est2.png?t=1744105729\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy armada is closing on your position from both sides. Establish a base and use all means to protect it. Commander, this is your last Iron Frontier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/text_223.png?t=1744105729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/St2.gif?t=1744105729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your army from dozens of units and buildings. Command your troops to hit the enemy where it hurts. Use airstrikes and other abilities to rain death on the battlefield!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/est4.png?t=1744105729\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your troops with hundreds of upgrades and power ups. Unlock new units, technologies and permanent upgrades to turn your army into a killing machine!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/est5.png?t=1744105729\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Annihilate enemy forces with cunning tactics and extreme firepower. Create insane builds to turn the battleground into a kill zone! No prisoners, no survivors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you on the battlefield!</p>","developers":["Bibamus"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/header.jpg?t=1744105729","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Bibamus. All right reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.2 GHz Dual Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<